  <title>LPCAMM2 x128 Type-3</title>
  <body>
	 <section id="SECTION_3CE3D6F0-6582-418D-952D-2DF6059F9037">
		<p>Pcb Type &amp; Thickness: Type-3, 0.9mm
		</p>
		<fig id="FIG_LPCAMM2_X128_TYPE-3_PCB_DQ_DQS_CA_CS_CLK_TOPOLOGY_DIAGRAM_1">
		  <title>LPCAMM2 x128 Type-3 PCB DQ, DQS, CA, CS, CLK Topology Diagram</title><image href="../images/GUID-FD7F6AE0-03EE-45B9-9B85-102BF0FD59FF.png" scalefit="yes" id="IMG_LPCAMM2_X128_TYPE-3_PCB_DQ_DQS_CA_CS_CLK_TOPOLOGY_DIAGRAM_1_JPG" />
		</fig>
